something strange...

I was playing a Valkyrie so I decided to stick around a while after
getting my quest stuff so I could up my strength.  In fact I stuck
around from 18/30 to 18/96.  At this point I decided to get out for a
while because I started to trip a LOT, and was not able to kick or use
a pick-axe because I was supposedly clumsy.  (I actually dropped my
pick-axe trying to take a swing at a boulder that was standing on a
giant corpse.)  A couple dozen moves later a ghost rises out of
nowhere and starts harrassing me, and that's when I decided to flee.  

